  },
  "distribution": "NVIDIA RTX SDK license retained and hashed; no SDK source vendored into project or relicensed. Fetch separately; host adapter is repository code.",
  "boundary": "SDK irradiance/distance blending + relocation/classification + actual probe ray transport + all primary/direct/gather/maintenance work. DDGI cannot be replaced by the repository RC control.",
  "semantic_requirements": [
    "BF-P grey rho=1, point NEE with shadow visibility, two-sided surfaces, common camera/resolution/state",
    "Finite T_B2: probe rays gather direct only; no recursive irradiance",
    "Finite T_B8 requires explicit seven-level ping-pong radiance-depth scheduling, not unconstrained recursive steady-state labelled finite truth",
    "Initial convergence cost and dynamic source/first-target/recovery histories retained",
    "Unmodified SDK managed/unmanaged allocation sites must join complete owned Vulkan lifetime ledger; all contexts counted",
    "Actual AMD Vulkan runtime smoke and correctness/quality against qualified refs before accepted Lane M DDGI campaign"
  ]
}
